# Accessibility Testing Rules

## WCAG Standard

- **Minimum**: WCAG 2.1 Level AA
- **Tags**: `wcag2a`, `wcag2aa`, `wcag21a`, `wcag21aa`
- **Optional**: WCAG 2.2 Level A/AA when available (use latest stable)

## Violation Handling

| Impact | Action |
|--------|--------|
| Critical | BLOCK — must fix before merge |
| Serious | BLOCK — must fix before merge |
| Moderate | WARN — should fix, add to tech debt tracker |
| Minor | INFO — consider fixing |

## Auto-Run Scope

Each unique page template gets an a11y audit. Focus on:
- Login / authentication pages
- Primary content pages (home, search results, detail view)
- Forms and data entry screens
- Navigation components

## Known Issues

If an a11y violation is accepted:
```typescript
// Exclude with a tracked issue link
const results = await new AxeBuilder({ page })
  .withRules(['color-contrast'])  // tracked in ISSUE-1234: third-party widget
  .analyze();
```
